## Stacking and focus

Clicking a window brings it to the foreground.

Use a reliable stacking order. The active window should have subtle visual emphasis, not an excessive glow.

## Minimize

Minimizing hides a window and leaves an entry in the bottom dock.

Clicking the dock entry restores that same window and its state.

## Maximize and restore

Maximize expands a window within the available desktop workspace.

Restoring returns it to its previous position and dimensions.

